]]&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/04/us/politics/france-jets-america-250.html</guid><pubDate>Sat, 04 Jul 2026 00:00:25 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>‘Who Should I Vote for?’ Voters Turn to A.I. Before Casting Their Ballots</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/04/us/politics/voters-ai-chatbots-elections.html</link><description>&lt;![CDATA[
