Jeremiah Hain, a psychotherapist in Los Angeles, routinely used ChatGPT for small tasks and recently employed it to help him choose a candidates in races for mayor and various other offices.
]]&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/04/us/politics/voters-ai-chatbots-elections.html</guid><pubDate>Sat, 04 Jul 2026 00:00:29 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>The Texas Hill Country Flood, One Year Later</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/04/us/texas-floods-2025-guadalupe-river.html</link><description>&lt;![CDATA[
