]]&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/04/us/white-nationalists-march-in-washington-amid-250th-anniversary-celebrations.html</guid><pubDate>Sat, 04 Jul 2026 12:57:20 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>For new citizens, it’s about having their voices heard. And about pizza.</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/live/2026/07/04/us/america-250-celebrations-fourth-july/naturalization-ceremony-monticello</link><description>&lt;![CDATA[
