Silverton, Colo., one of many towns in the state forced to cancel their Fourth of July fireworks celebrations, in September.
]]&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/04/us/politics/fireworks-canceled-wildfire-danger.html</guid><pubDate>Sat, 04 Jul 2026 10:31:20 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>TV coverage of the Fourth of July will emphasize holiday festivities, not Trump’s speech</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/live/2026/07/04/us/america-250-celebrations-fourth-july/tv-coverage-of-the-fourth-of-july-will-emphasize-holiday-festivities-not-trumps-speech</link><description>&lt;![CDATA[
