The scene outside the National Archives on Saturday. The major broadcast networks are concentrating on events marking the July 4th holiday.
]]&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/live/2026/07/04/us/america-250-celebrations-fourth-july/tv-coverage-of-the-fourth-of-july-will-emphasize-holiday-festivities-not-trumps-speech</guid><pubDate>Sat, 04 Jul 2026 11:28:32 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Democrats Clash With Trump, as Political Tensions Rise on America’s 250th</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/04/us/politics/democrats-clash-trump-america-250th-birthday.html</link><description>&lt;![CDATA[
