Gov. Gavin Newsom of California in Sacramento in January. Mr. Newsom, a potential 2028 presidential candidate, has been a vocal critic of President Trump.
]]&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/04/us/politics/democrats-clash-trump-america-250th-birthday.html</guid><pubDate>Sat, 04 Jul 2026 13:04:53 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>